# Witness data for `X15Landing`

One line per configuration `(c₄, c₆, c₉)` of landing positions of the exit
vertices `4, 6, 9` of `X15` on a 13-vertex path (`13` = no landing).  Vertices
of the 28-vertex glued graph are `0 … 14` (`X15`) and `15 … 27` (the path
`p₀ … p₁₂`); every number `v` is written as the character `Char.ofNat (48 + v)`.
A line is the three configuration characters, then `C` followed by a cycle of
length 4, 8 or 16, or `P` followed by two induced 13-vertex paths (13 + 13
characters).  Generated by an (unverified) search; every entry is re-checked by
`native_decide` in `X15Landing`.
-/

